    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2019-boundary-06: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.46";
    dc:description "Large comparative databases can test conservation of mechanisms and selected functional capacities. The broad continuum claim is interpretive, and many rival accounts predict the same molecular homology.";
