    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Define a graded set of computational capacities and compare their mechanisms across bacteria, unicellular eukaryotes, non-neural metazoans, and nervous systems, testing phylogenetic continuity and homologous molecular implementation.";
